@startuml Sequence Diagram - Upgrade Plan

actor "Admin" as User
participant "BillingView" as BillingView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> BillingView : 1 Open billing/plan page
activate BillingView
BillingView -> BillingView : 2 Display available plans

Admin -> BillingView : 3 Select new plan
Admin -> BillingView : 4 Click "Upgrade Plan" button

BillingView -> BillingView : 5 Confirm upgrade action

BillingView -> ClerkAuth : 6 Send upgrade request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 7 Update plan in backend
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 8 Update user/organization plan record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 9 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> BillingView : 10 Success notification
BillingView -> User : 11 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate BillingView

@enduml
